  "summary_html": "<p>On July 31, 2025, Banno published a statement that Jack Henry will retire NetTeller Online Banking, NetTeller Small Business Cash Management, and NetTeller Commercial Cash Management on <time datetime=\"2027-07-01\">July 1, 2027</time>. On that date, the notice says, access to NetTeller front-end services will be turned off and existing NetTeller and NetTeller Cash Management contracts will not be renewed. <a href=\"https://banno.com/statements/2025-07-31-retiring-netteller-2027/\" rel=\"noopener\">Read the original notice</a>.</p><p>The institutions below showed a NetTeller login host on a <strong>login-page scan dated November 17, 2026</strong>. They may be affected. A NetTeller login is not evidence of which core system an institution uses, and this list does not identify anyone\u2019s core.</p>"
